From b536aa3ec2b6d930b99911e303027aea411cf32b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x <x@x>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 10:30:23 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] riscv: k230: k230_set_dtb command and the vendor splash
 glue

k230_set_dtb is a reduced port of the vendor command. The RM69A10 splash
sources are Canaan's, copied in at build time by the Nix derivation; this
commit carries only the glue: compatibility headers, the GPIO helper, the
last-stage-init event, the /chosen canaan,stage1-splash property and the
Kconfig options.
---
